bohmerang (https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/boeing-b-52-stratofortress-38b0c64bd552431394efa8625d7f5144),
licensed under CC BY 4.0 (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). See CREDITS-bohmerang-B52.txt.

